ss:Type="Number">1.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">200 g Greek yogurt; 100 g Mixed berries; 40 g Granola; 1 tsp Honey</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Spoon yogurt into a bowl. 2. Top with berries, granola and honey.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Creamy yogurt with berries, honey and crunchy granola.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b-veggie-omelette</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Veggie Omelette</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">breakfast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">american</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">eggs</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">281</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vegetarian, keto, gluten_free</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4.3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">137.7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">64.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">611.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2.3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">90</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">194.9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1.3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3 pieces Eggs; 1/2 piece Bell pepper; 50 g Spinach; 1 tsp Olive oil</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Whisk eggs; sauté pepper and spinach. 2. Add eggs, cook until set, fold.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fluffy three-egg omelette with peppers and spinach.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b-banana-oatmeal</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Peanut Banana Oatmeal</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">breakfast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">american</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">dairy</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">557</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">84</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vegetarian</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">3.2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">353.9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">169.9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1089.4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">3.1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">10.8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">69.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1.4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60 g Rolled oats; 250 ml Milk; 1 piece Banana; 1 tbsp Peanut butter</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Simmer oats in milk 5 min. 2. Top with banana and peanut butter.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Warm oats with banana, cinnamon and peanut butter.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b-tofu-wrap</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tofu Scramble Wrap</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">breakfast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">american</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">tofu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">315</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vegan, vegetarian</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">6.4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">456</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">131.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">625.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">11.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">168.8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">150 g Firm tofu; 1 piece Whole-wheat tortilla; 40 g Spinach; 1 tsp Turmeric; 1 tsp olive oil</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Crumble and fry tofu with turmeric and spinach. 2. Wrap in the tortilla.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turmeric tofu scramble with veggies in a warm tortilla.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b-shakshuka</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shakshuka</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">breakfast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">middle_eastern</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">eggs</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">492</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vegetarian, gluten_free</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">5.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">411.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">83.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1310.8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">3.4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2.2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">206.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">158.1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2 pieces Eggs; 1 can Chopped tomatoes; 1 piece Bell pepper; 1/2 piece Onion; 1 tbsp Olive oil; 40 g Feta; 1 tsp Paprika</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Simmer peppers, tomatoes and paprika. 2. Crack in eggs; cook until set.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eggs poached in a spiced tomato and pepper sauce.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b-salmon-bagel</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Smoked Salmon Bagel</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">breakfast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">american</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">fish</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">459</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mediterranean</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">3.8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">80.9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">85.1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">556.9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1.7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">13.7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4.2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">87</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2.7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1 piece Wholegrain bagel; 80 g Smoked salmon; 2 tbsp Cream cheese; 1/2 piece Cucumber</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Toast and spread the bagel. 2. Layer salmon and cucumber.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wholegrain bagel with cream cheese and smoked salmon.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b-avocado-toast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Avocado &amp; Chickpea Toast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">breakfast</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mediterranean</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legumes</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">637</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">72</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vegan, vegetarian, mediterranean</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4.7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">157.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">110.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">1212.3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">2.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">35.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">264.8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2 slices Sourdough bread; 1 piece Avocado; 80 g Chickpeas; 1/2 piece Lemon</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Toast bread. 2. Smash avocado with chickpeas and lemon; pile on top.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Smashed avocado and chickpeas on toasted sourdough.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">l-chicken-quinoa</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Chicken Quinoa Bowl</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">lunch</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mediterranean</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">chicken</